  description: 'Ingrid brought two things home: a healer''s hands and the old ways of cleansing cursed things. Give her the Alchemist''s work and build the Purification Altar she showed you (G). Her Cauldron brews healing draughts.'
  chain: Hands at Home
  journalNotes: Ingrid knows the old ways of cleansing cursed things and is cagey about where she learned them. Give her a job from the H window. Cursed Essence is useless raw; the altar is where it starts to pay.
